OL,3,GNEWSAPaint analysed at 'world's oldest'
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn analysis of the paint used at what
OL,7,Fis believed to be the world's oldest
OL,8,Frailway station is being carried out in
OL,9,Fa bid to identify the colour of its
OL,10,Foriginal decor.
OL,12,FDating back to 1827, Heighington
OL,13,FStation, in County Durham, was part of
OL,14,Fthe Stockton and Darlington railway
OL,15,Fline, which was the first passenger
OL,16,Frailway to use steam trains.
OL,18,FDerelict since 2017 the building is now
OL,19,Fowned by Friends of Stockton and
OL,20,FDarlington Railway (S&DR), and the
OL,21,Fcharity is currently considering ways
OL,22,Fto bring it back into use.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
